  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A member of the class of benzoic acids that is 4-phenoxybenzoic acid in which the hydrogens <em>ortho</em> to the phenoxy group are substituted by butylamino and sulfamoyl groups. Bumetanide is a diuretic, and is used for treatment of oedema associated with congestive heart failure, hepatic and renal disease."
  ],
